criteria:
- batch-args: batch is a command: parseArgs accepts batch --parent <id> --yes with optional --base, --parent-base, --width <positive integer>, --json and --output, and rejects a missing --parent or --yes, a zero or non-integer width, repeated options and options that belong to other commands, while --parent-base and --width are refused on every other command and batch --help documents the command
