- batch-guard: batch refuses to start on a dirty working tree, its guard reports a change when HEAD or the tree differs from the start, and an interrupt signal aborts the batch and exits 130 or 143
- shared-review-wiring: review and batch build their review command options through one shared function, the review command behaves as before, and the existing review tests pass unchanged
